                      'Est. BMI: ',
                      style: TextStyle(
                        fontFamily: 'Poppins',
                        fontSize: 13.sp,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w500,
                        color: OnboardingScaffold.textDark,
                      ),
                    ),
                    Text(
                      _bmi.toStringAsFixed(1),
                      style: TextStyle(
                        fontFamily: 'Poppins',
                        fontSize: 14.sp,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
                        color: OnboardingScaffold.green,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ],
